  "notes": [
    "2026 URSSAF rates on turnover: 25.6% + 0.2% CFP for non-regulated liberal professions (BNC), 21.2% + up to 0.3% CFP for BIC services. The versement libératoire is optional and depends on household income.",
    "Under the VAT franchise no VAT is charged; above it the standard rate is 20% (reduced 10%, 5.5%, 2.1%).",
    "The micro presets reserve the URSSAF contributions; income tax under the progressive scale is due separately unless the versement libératoire is chosen. The reserve check shows both.",
    "Rule packs are information, not tax advice. The user confirms the percentages; the vault enforces what the user chose."
